#29600
"Chamber of Twilight"
"Carved out of the substance of the mountain itself, this room shows delicate
and intricate hand carved details and motifs on the stark grey granite walls,
giving the cold hard stone some substance and texture.  The room is empty save
for a fountain which dominates the center of the floor seemingly sculpted out
of the very substance of the rock, giving the illusion that perhaps this is a
direct tap into a hidden aquifer.
"
""
