"fountain"
"Naturally formed from the floor of the cavern, this fountain is made of
igneous rock slightly different in texture from the surrounding granite.  The
overall appearance is that of a molten lava tube which serendipitously met a
hidden aquifer causing the solidification and formation of an outlet for the
water.
