#29601
"Foyer of Decision"
"Cold sturdy granite walls line the way here ending in a \"T\" junction with a
corridor leading east and west.  A beautifully carved staircase is at the
center of the room leading to an unknown room above.  There is absolutely
nothing else in the chamber except for the granite staircase, giving the
impression of a stark yet very clean and elegant design on the part of the
builder.
"
""
