#29602
"Arena of Twilight"
"This chamber is devoid of any markings on the walls or of any furniture save
for a black and white circle brilliantly emblazoned on the center of the
floor.  Two semicircular shapes reminiscent of gigantic commas, one of white
and one of black comprise the circle, representing one of the classic symbols
of the eternal struggle between the light and dark.
"
