#29604
"Chamber of Wealth"
"Glyphs of gold and silver decorate the uppermost margins of the walls before
the joint with the ceiling.  A small square window is built into the northern
wall representing the deposit cubicle.  While there is no definite living
presence in the chamber, there is a strange crisp feeling in the air as if
there was something otherworldly at work in this room.  The beautifully carved
granite staircase is present centrally in this chamber, linking it to the
rooms above and below.
"
"[Orb] STORAGE ROOM, DO NOT PURGE
