"Chamber of Unity"
"The granite staircase ends here in a cul de sac of sorts.  Carelessly arranged
large pillows dominate the chamber with no apparent exit except via the stairs
to the chamber below.  Bold and colorful tapestries decorate the granite walls
of this chamber, giving it some character and warmth.
"
