#29606
"Short Tunnel"
"A cul-de-sac of sorts has been created here within the very heart of the
Dragonspires mountains, carved out with meticulous care with a smooth finish.
The only way out of this corner is to the east where the tunnel widens out
into a chamber.  Dark smooth granite walls give off no heat and there is an
overall feeling of coldness, or rather the lack of warmth.  A large, roughly
round granite boulder has been set against the western wall of this chamber.
"
""
